{"title": "Bloodthirst", "pageid": 9688, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bloodthirst", "categories": ["Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Simple weapons", "Daggers", "Legendary items", "Sources of Piercing damage", "Off-hand set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the condition used by Gnolls, see <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst_(Condition)\" title=\"Bloodthirst (Condition)\">Bloodthirst (Condition)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-legendary\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bloodthirst_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Bloodthirst_Icon.png/300px-Bloodthirst_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Bloodthirst_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bloodthirst image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Bloodthirst_Icon.png/300px-Bloodthirst_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Bloodthirst_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Bloodthirst</span></a> is a legendary +2 <a href=\"/wiki/Dagger\" title=\"Dagger\">Dagger</a> wielded by <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> which makes critical hits more likely. Also, depending on which hand this weapon is equipped on, it can either make targets vulnerable to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span> or more likely to be hit.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The Lord of Murder wasn't always a lord. He was once just a petty killer. When <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a> first drew blood in a Baldurian back-alley, it dropped to the ground and lingered. When he ascended, this dried blood-drop grew, warped - and became sharp.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4 + 2 (3~6) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength or Dexterity modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daggers\" title=\"Daggers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/25px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/38px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/50px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daggers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png/25px-Daggers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Daggers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daggers\" title=\"Daggers\">Daggers</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Legendary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Legendary</span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Enchantment: <b>+ 2</b></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"One-Handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> One-Handed</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Finesse_Icon.png/25px-Finesse_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Finesse_Icon.png/38px-Finesse_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/1b/Finesse_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Finesse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Finesse_Icon.png/25px-Finesse_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Finesse_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">Finesse</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Light_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Light_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">Light</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a></dd>\